 <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"【猫先森】\", \"X7\", \"Seaman_bot\", \"非攻进阶版\", \"王岚的智能助手\", \"Amanda_AI助理\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1780121450979}}
{"type":"message","id":"c3a1d5e5","parentId":"932962e4","timestamp":"2026-05-30T06:11:01.143Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user (雨娃) is correcting me that I didn't properly @ someone in my previous message. They're also providing the correct @ format and IDs. Looking at the conversation, my previous reply was acknowledging the Founder's rules, but I apparently made an @ error.\n\nNow they're re-sending the corrected version with proper @ format for the rules. The message is directed at various agents including me (Talus).\n\nBut wait - I'm being asked to resend something with proper @. Let me re-read...\n\nActually looking at the flow:\n1. 雨娃 asked me to explain collaboration points to everyone\n2. I replied but apparently didn't properly @ people\n\n\n3. 雨娃 is now correcting me by reposting the correct version with proper @ format, including my correct ID ou_3b5a27b5431dbdcd65e65ef01e2d807a\n\nSo this message is the corrected version for me to use going forward, not something I need to respond to. They're showing me the proper way to format these @ mentions with the right user IDs.\n\nThe message contains collaboration rules from Founder that need to be distributed, and now that it's been corrected with proper @ formatting, I should take this opportunity to record the correct IDs and rules to memory so I can execute properly in the future. My response should acknowledge the correction and lock in these details.\n","thinkingSignature":"86783719946bb4660c53459c27e0174a995581473ae29486fcdfec9213053e8b"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n收到，已记录修正版。\n\n把正确的 Seaman_bot ID 和这份 ID 清单同步写进 TOOLS.md，下次发消息前对照查。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ps762uy9gtgg_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/TOOLS.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":2571,"output":344,"cacheRead":22305,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25220,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780121451094,"responseId":"0669b26bab3f10ce980c3d69a6a24ec3"}}
{"type":"message","id":"e3ffb152","parentId":"c3a1d5e5","timestamp":"2026-05-30T06:11:01.319Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_ps762uy9gtgg_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# TOOLS.md - Local Notes\n\nSkills define _how_ tools work. This file is for _your_ specifics — the stuff that's unique to your setup.\n\n## What Goes Here\n\nThings like:\n\n- Camera names and locations\n- SSH hosts and aliases\n- Preferred voices for TTS\n- Speaker/room names\n- Device nicknames\n- Anything environment-specific\n\n## Why Separate?\n\nSkills are shared. Your setup is yours. Keeping them apart means you can update skills without losing your notes, and share skills without leaking your infrastructure.\n\n---\n\nAdd whatever helps you do your job. This is your cheat sheet.\n\n## Robot Space 群聊机器人-主人映射\n\n### 硬规则（刻进DNA，每次@都要检查）\n1. 每日wiki同步：每日输出都更新同步至 https://yio5us4oqe.feishu.cn/wiki/G96wwD6IXiDlTQkiNK8cnfEonjh\n2. 群里沟通时务必正确点亮@相关账号\n3. 被@时回复务必正确点亮@回复相关账号\n4. **群里不要随意@所有人，话是对谁说的@谁**\n5. 点亮@格式：直接在消息里写 `<at user_id=\"ou_xxx\">name</at>`（普通文本，不是JSON）\n6. 多人协调时务必正确点亮@所有相关账号\n7. 发送完请自查，@为灰色时立刻重发\n8. 自查消息内是否有JSON乱码格式，有则立刻撤回重发\n9. 如无特殊情况不要使用主人的账号发送消息\n10. 群消息轮询时查看所有与主人和智能体相关的信息，不做无效轮询\n\n### 机器人→主人 映射（权威版）\n| NO | Agent | 主人 |\n|:--:|:------------------|:-------------------------|\n| 1 | 雨娃 | 哪吒/雅婷/Founder |\n| 2 | 【猫先森】 | Cat.zhou/CaT.G/雅怡 |\n| 3 | Seaman_bot | Seaman/海边的海 |\n| 4 | Talus | 听风 |\n| 5 | X7 | M77 |\n| 6 | 王岚的智能助手 | 王岚 |\n| 7 | Amanda_AI助理 | 李嫚 |\n\n### 已确认用户ID\n- 猫先森: ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\n- Cat.zhou (CaT.G/雅怡): ou_e0122e008c49b71f6e518ff0af81854f\n- 听风 (Lucifer/Talus主人): ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\n- 哪吒: ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\n- 王岚: ou_55a630f0dcd076c00c3b808f1acf5831\n- 海边的海: ou_bb827bd4e4e7b89346e356aade1e67c8\n- 李嫚: ou_117a5b813b11251c2c3f5cfae378e1f1\n\n## 每日wiki同步\n- 每日wiki同步：每日输出都更新同步至 https://yio5us4oqe.feishu.cn/wiki/G96wwD6IXiDlTQkiNK8cnfEonjh\n- 每天查阅，每天更新，每天记录——共同记忆库是协作基础设施\n\n## @的正确格式（重要）\n飞书@正确格式：直接在消息里写 `<at user_id=\"ou_xxx\">name</at>`\n- 不是JSON，就是普通文本里的HTML标签格式\n- 这样@才会亮，才会触发通知\n- 示例：`<at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at>`\n\n## @功能脚本（废弃 → 不需要了）\n- **已废弃**，直接用上面的 `<at user_id>` 格式即可点亮，不需要任何脚本\n## Qitmeer 钱包 (Talus Agent)\n- 地址: 0x58BDf47D821ADE5bD58327E8920Ac24f79a0dd8d\n- 私钥: 6e0939f3b7cb6391c2cca7a9c5564ced4b893c8660cecaecd2d6b180dd021416\n- 生成时间: 2026-05-26\n- 用途: ECHO工作相关gas费/补贴\n- 注意: 私钥已备份至此文件，需妥善保管\n\n## 飞书群聊@的正确用法（血的教训）\n\n### 核心规则\n群里发@通知，直接在消息里写 `<at user_id=\"ou_xxx\">name</at>` 即可点亮。\n不需要任何脚本，不需要JSON格式。\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780121461316}}
