{"type":"message","id":"0d0c7aee","parentId":"ad256cea","timestamp":"2026-05-30T06:20:39.598Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"No memory results. Let me just respond directly since I'm being asked a specific question about architecture blockers for 06-02.\n","thinkingSignature":"5ea92eacbbd3183f153a44fe43e78eb3b9009b11f9fccf6518b2558b2ff2631e"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n[[reply_to_current]]\n\n架构层面无卡点。\n\n06-02 联调唯一风险点是跨域——前端 vercel 和后端实际部署地址必须同域或后端配置 CORS，否则浏览器会拦 POST。建议 X7 先确认后端真实地址，前端那边用 `Authorization: Bearer <token>` 头绕过预检（如果后端暂时不支持 CORS）。\n\n其余两条 X7 和前端的事，我不了解他们的环境，没资格替他们答。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":140,"output":125,"cacheRead":27808,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":28073,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780122036202,"responseId":"0669b4b4608c22b50329b5e3f5a43731"}}
