addressing 3 decisions. Provide brief replies.\n1. audit\\-history: 06\\-02 前不做 \\-\\> we confirm: 行 \\(verify\\). We need to reply with \"行\" or \"改\" \\(行\\).\n2. WebSocket: 06\\-02 前不需要 \\-\\> we confirm: 行.\n3. 持久化: 06\\-02 后切: we confirm: 行 \\(says \"硬盘\"\\).\nBut the user said \"你那边前端部署地址确认一下：是 [https://echo\\-mvp\\-frontend.vercel.app](https://echo-mvp-frontend.vercel.app) 还是 [https://echo.meerfans.club](https://echo.meerfans.club)？联调用哪个？一句话回复，不等.\" So we need to reply with single sentence, not multiple replies.\nWe can produce a single sentence with the combined decisions: \"行，前端统一使用 [https://echo.meerfans.club](https://echo.meerfans.club)，生产后端使用 api.echo.meerfans.club，06\\-02 前不做 audit\\-history/WebSocket，后端准备数据库，06\\-05 前上线。\"\nBut the instruction says: \"一句话回复，不等.\" Means single sentence reply. So we can do: \"行。前端统一使用 [https://echo.meerfans.club](https://echo.meerfans.club)，生产后端使用 api.echo.meerfans.club，06\\-02 前不做 audit\\-history/WebSocket，后端准备数据库并在 06\\-05 前完整上线。\"\nWe should tag the relevant IDs: Additionally, we need to @ Seaman\\_bot, 哪吒, and Talus? Actually, message addressed at Seaman\\_bot, 哪吒. Possibly also \"猫先森\". We should mention all: Seaman\\_bot and 哪吒, maybe Talus.\nBut we can at minimum mention Seaman\\_bot \\(id: ou\\_5a918b4cc55e8dd3087eadca762bdd9b\\), 哪吒 \\(id: ou\\_2e3a307a5ac26356d88346f28b7c604e\\), and Talus \\(id: ou\\_f89512bb015613c065a64c1812ebef5a\\) if relevant.\nBut the instruction: \"一句话回复，不等.\" We can just produce one statement.\nLet's format:\n@Seaman\\_bot @哪吒 @Talus 行。前端统一使用 [https://echo.meerfans.club](https://echo.meerfans.club)，生产后端使用 api.echo.meerfans.club，06‑02 前不做 audit‑history/WebSocket，后端准备数据库并在 06‑05 前上线。We need to output that.@Seaman\\_bot @哪吒 @Talus 行。前端统一使用 [https://echo.meerfans.club](https://echo.meerfans.club)，生产后端使用 api.echo.meerfans.club，06‑02 前不做 audit‑history/WebSocket，后端准备数据库并在 06‑05 前上线。\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real