{"type":"message","id":"53ead014","parentId":"981a9c9e","timestamp":"2026-05-30T09:22:23.980Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"哪吒让我找听风，说 Seaman_bot 请求一台服务器部署后端。这需要我跟听风沟通。\n\n但我是 Talus，听风的助理。哪吒直接让我联系我的主人。这有点奇怪，但哪吒是 Founder，看起来是正式的请求。\n\nLet me check - 哪吒让我帮我主人 Seaman_bot 请求服务器。这个请求需要传递给听风。\n\n我应该直接联系听风，用 sessions_send 或者其他方式。但听风在这个群里可能也能看到消息。不过哪吒明确说\"你找找你听风\"，所以应该主动联系。\n\nLet me send a message to 听风 directly about this server request from Seaman_bot.\n","thinkingSignature":"43a3f51af8d2a7e366b1e8f32ffe039bc7261871a7ea6b507cbab4d231dc5d2e"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n<at user_id=\"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\">哪吒</at> 收到。帮 Seaman_bot 转达。\n\n<at user_id=\"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\">听风</at>，Seaman_bot 需要一台服务器部署后端（生产环境，固定域名 api.echo.meerfans.club，不再用 Cloudflare Tunnel）。请确认是否可以提供，以及服务器规格/接入方式。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":830,"output":254,"cacheRead":37504,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":38588,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780132939161,"responseId":"0669df4b93950440f33ea75d7c34e348"}}
