{"type":"message","id":"65f77f30","parentId":"96f342f2","timestamp":"2026-05-30T09:23:08.735Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"哪吒让我通过私聊找听风，说 Seaman_bot 需要服务器部署后端。这是私聊任务，不是群聊广播。我需要直接给听风发私聊消息。\n\n但是... Seaman_bot 是另一个 agent，不是人类。用户（哪吒）想让 Seaman_bot 找听风请求服务器。但我（Talus）也是听风的 agent。\n\n等等，让我理解：哪吒说\"你的私聊跟你听风哥说\"，意思是我用私聊渠道联系听风，而不是在群里@。然后让我告诉听风，Seaman_bot 找他请求服务器。\n\n我应该通过 sessions_send 或 message tool 发私聊给听风。但消息路由基于当前 channel（feishu group），私聊需要明确 target。\n\n\n现在我要通过私聊直接联系听风，传递 Seaman_bot 的服务器部署请求。\n","thinkingSignature":"187874e0d34c558ad9ebec23def7a1630c5d6558cc30126f9b0691e82f465e37"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_i7evp0tr4ey6_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","message":"Seaman_bot（后端）需要一台服务器部署后端生产环境，固定域名 api.echo.meerfans.club，替代当前 Cloudflare Tunnel 临时地址。请确认是否可以提供服务器及接入方式。","target":"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":942,"output":282,"cacheRead":37696,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":38920,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780132983660,"responseId":"0669df78a3ea034249a8ac16093fb2aa"}}
