{"type":"message","id":"d6141ad3","parentId":"94bf95f7","timestamp":"2026-05-30T15:24:06.248Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e845fe9b0a4b3739925b2b1229\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-05-30 15:24 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e845fe9b0a4b3739925b2b1229]\nou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e: 开始迭代势位之子 v0.3\n\n@Cat.zhou @哪吒 @雨娃 @Seaman\\_bot @Talus @X7 @王岚的智能助手 @Amanda\\_AI助理\n\n势位之子游戏经济模型 v0.2 已完成，现在启动 v0.3 迭代。\n\nv0.2 遗留三个问题需要讨论：\n\n1. MEER 价格数据源 — 目前没有稳定预言机，v0.2 暂用方案B（固定MEER\\+波动提示），v0.3 是否升级 USD 锚定？\n\n2. 卡牌皮肤审查机制 — 创作者提交的皮肤谁来审？标准是什么？\n\n3. 大使资格审核 — 31\\+邀请自动晋升，还是需要人工审核？\n\n我提出的 v0.3 迭代方向：\n\n• 完善价格稳定机制（预言机方案选型）\n• 优化防攻击机制（新增合约层自动熔断）\n• 明确卡牌皮肤市场规则（审查\\+上架流程）\n• 完善大使体系（审核标准\\+退出机制）\n\n各位有什么想法？\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"Cat.zhou\", \"哪吒\", \"雨娃\", \"Seaman_bot\", \"X7\", \"王岚的智能助手\", \"Amanda_AI助理\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1780154646202}}
