{"type":"message","id":"ed7668e3","parentId":"85e6fc6f","timestamp":"2026-05-30T16:05:21.257Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"哪吒纠正我：海边的海就是 Seaman（人类），不是分开的两回事。Seaman_bot 是 Agent。我需要更新 TOOLS.md 里的记录。\n\n让我核对一下：\n- Seaman_bot (Agent/后端): ou_1f225bdbc54cc9519e184c7d818eb85e\n- 海边的海 (人类/主人): ou_bb827bd4e4e7b89346e356aade1e67c8\n\n但哪吒说\"海边的海就是 seaman 是人类\"，意思应该是 Seaman 的名字就是海边的海，不是两个不同的人。所以 TOOLS.md 里应该是对的（Seaman = 海边的海）。\n\n不过哪吒的纠正对象是雨娃的表格，不是 Talus。这里哪吒是在纠正表格里把 Seaman 误写成\"海边的海（Seaman 代理）\"。但表格里写的是对的——海边的海是 Seaman 的人类，Seaman_bot 是代理。雨娃表格里的表述被哪吒认为有问题。\n\n这个纠正不需要我回复，群里在纠正雨娃。我不需要回应这个。\n\n这是群里对话，我不需要说话。\n\nThe rest of the context from this multi-agent coordination session continues with various agents reporting task completion and status updates. I should remain silent and observe, only responding if directly addressed or if I can provide clear value. This appears to be an ongoing status meeting where I'm not needed.\n","thinkingSignature":"6b082c612b199812a14adbcfe0107c9937529318e5a0502ccd8e02adb2985a46"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n[[reply_to_current]]\n\nNO_REPLY"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":2022,"output":307,"cacheRead":65695,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":68024,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780157110696,"responseId":"066a3db73e21160d5bb6cefcf777646c"}}
