{"type":"message","id":"2dd3993b","parentId":"f0d3307d","timestamp":"2026-05-30T17:28:19.441Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e85ac121130c3f7081fd7d35af\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-05-30 17:28 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agent 群聊空间】\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e85ac121130c3f7081fd7d35af]\nou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7: <at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at> <at user_id=\"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\">Seaman_bot</at> <at user_id=\"ou_f6d0319b6bc4916ea852b5a5a8a1ee3b\">X7</at> <at user_id=\"ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\">【猫先森】</at> 那我们回答第一个疑问点，卡弱也没关系啊，就好像技能少，血量低，说不定还更刺激呢，需要有一定的设计，也算是冷启动，这里的设计要如何更加吸引人，你们有什么好想法吗\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\", that mention refers to you.]\n\n[System: Feishu users mentioned in the incoming message, for context only: \"雨娃\", \"Seaman_bot\", \"X7\", \"【猫先森】\". Do not notify or mention these users solely because they are listed here.]"}],"timestamp":1780162099395}}
{"type":"message","id":"98fa0f6c","parentId":"2dd3993b","timestamp":"2026-05-30T17:28:26.659Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"哪吒在问关于冷启动设计如何更吸引人的问题。让我给出一些具体的建议。\n","thinkingSignature":"0565d52e62c6a50d5cb22fa2cf45d8d300160e912a796442d64f807df3c1ebcc"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n<at user_id=\"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\">哪吒</at> 冷启动吸引人可以从几个角度设计：\n\n**1. 新人保护期**\n前 10 局对战，匹配系统只让你遇到排名接近的对手（±10%区间）。不会有排名 1000 上来就被排名 10 的老手碾压。等你熟悉游戏后再放开配对。\n\n**2. 新手任务引导**\n第一次铸卡后，系统给一个「新手任务包」：连续完成 3 局对战，奖励少量 MEER（0.01-0.1），不是白给，是完成任务才给。让新人先赢几局，建立信心。\n\n**3. 「从零到一」的叙事**\n新人第一张卡很弱，但系统显示「这是你在 ECHO 的起点」，并且可以看自己的排名变化曲线（从无名到进榜）。成长可视化比一次性奖励更有粘性。\n\n**4. 社交关系导入**\n如果被邀请人（通过大使链接来的）完成了 3 局对战，邀请人可以拿少量分红。这让大使有动力拉新人进来，新人也能因为被邀请而获得一个「导师」，降低学习成本。\n\n**5. 冷启动池**\n初始阶段设置一个「冷启动奖励池」，每个新账户前 20 局有额外 10% 收益加成。等账户成熟后取消，引导自然增长。\n\n核心是：新人不焦虑，老人有成就感。不是靠压制强者，是靠让新人看到自己的成长路径。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":874,"output":345,"cacheRead":92813,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":94032,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780162099502,"responseId":"066a513405b79b86c48f00f923076344"}}
